          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 200
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "Then Sophia conceived a thought. It was a thought from herself.",
          "es": "Entonces Sofía concibió un pensamiento. Era un pensamiento que salía de ella misma."
        },
        {
          "en": "She wanted to bring forth a likeness, something that would come out of her.",
          "es": "Quiso dar a luz una semejanza, algo que saliera de ella."
        },
        {
          "en": "She wanted to do it on her own.",
          "es": "Quiso hacerlo por su cuenta."
        },
        {
          "en": "This was the desire of Sophia.",
          "es": "Este fue el deseo de Sofía."
        }
      ]
    },
